  "details": "- CVE-2026-59691: fix a heap buffer overflow in the rfbsrc RRE, CoRRE and\n  hextile decoders, which wrote 32-bit pixels into a buffer sized for the\n  negotiated bits-per-pixel; write through the correct type for 1, 2 and\n  4 bytespp and reject any other format, and read colour values at the\n  negotiated width at all seven call sites instead of a fixed four bytes\n- CVE-2026-59692: fix a stack buffer overflow in the DTLS connection\n  handler, which printed the peer certificate subject DN into a fixed\n  2048-byte stack buffer; allocate it from the returned length instead\n  and bound the read",
